FINDING: raw input delivered 243 events and the window message queue delivered 242. These are different queues and the difference is the point; they are not summed anywhere in this report.
         Known innocent causes: a held key auto-repeats into the message queue and not into raw input; pointer motion is coalesced per frame for the message queue and delivered per HID report to raw input; and a window without the foreground receives raw input and no keystrokes at all.
